; Run-Archive - a release archive tested as a user gets it: unpacked into a new
; drawer, the game's data copied in, started through the launcher Doom3 (and
; its Doom3.script) with nothing on its command line: a first start, which an
; autoexec.cfg in its save directory ends (quit after some frames). Then the
; drawer's own game (its libs/ and shaders/) runs the timedemo as the bench
; package does (a timedemo from autoexec.cfg runs before the session's
; commands exist, or, after a wait, stops its timed pass after 1 frame:
; archive-20261120-164628, -165751). Afterwards: T:doom3-out.txt (the
; launcher's output), the game's logs and saved settings, and the shader
; records in T: (none, when the drawer's shaders/ served every program).
;   Execute Run-Archive ARC=Doom3-Amiga-1.0-beta6.lha
; DIR (default Stuff:d3test) is deleted first and, unless KEEP=1, afterwards.
.key ARC/A,DATA,DIR,KEEP
.def DATA "Stuff:doom3"
.def DIR "Stuff:d3test"
.def KEEP 0
.bra {
.ket }

FailAt 21
MakeDir results >NIL:
Set pkg `CD`
; the shader records of earlier runs out of T: (OGLES2Cache: is not assigned here)
Delete T:#?.(v3dp|v3ds) QUIET >NIL:
Delete T:doom3-out.txt QUIET >NIL:
Avail FLUSH >NIL:
If EXISTS {DIR}
  Delete {DIR} ALL QUIET FORCE >NIL:
EndIf
MakeDir {DIR}
lha x {ARC} {DIR}/ >results/unpack.txt
List {DIR} ALL FILES LFORMAT "%P%N %L" >results/drawer.txt
Copy {DATA}/base/pak#?.pk4 {DIR}/Doom3/base/ QUIET
MakeDir {DIR}/Doom3/save {DIR}/Doom3/save/base >NIL:
; 1: the launcher's first start, ended by autoexec.cfg once the menu is up
Echo "wait 300; quit" >{DIR}/Doom3/save/base/autoexec.cfg
Echo "started {DIR}/Doom3/Doom3"
{DIR}/Doom3/Doom3
Echo "launcher exit code $RC" >results/launcher.txt
CD $pkg
Copy T:doom3-out.txt results/ QUIET
Copy {DIR}/Doom3/save/dhewm3log.txt results/ QUIET
Copy {DIR}/Doom3/save/base/dhewm.cfg results/ QUIET
Delete {DIR}/Doom3/save/base/autoexec.cfg QUIET >NIL:
; 2: the drawer's game, from its drawer, runs the timedemo (with sound: a silent
; one crashes) and quits
CD {DIR}/Doom3
Stack 9000000
SetEnv SDL_AUDIODRIVER paula
Echo "started {DIR}/Doom3/dhewm3 +timeDemo demo1 usecache quit"
dhewm3 +set fs_basepath "{DIR}/Doom3" +set r_fullscreen 1 +set com_preloadDemos 1 +timeDemo demo1 usecache quit >$pkg/results/timedemo.txt
Echo "exit code $RC" >>$pkg/results/timedemo.txt
UnSetEnv SDL_AUDIODRIVER
CD $pkg
Copy {DIR}/Doom3/save/dhewm3log.txt results/timedemo.log QUIET
List T:#?.(v3dp|v3ds) >results/T-records.txt
If {KEEP} EQ 0
  Delete {DIR} ALL QUIET FORCE >NIL:
EndIf
Search results/timedemo.txt "frames rendered" NONUM
